## XML / .NET project & config files — VS Dark+ (Smax)
syntax xml "\.(xml|xsd|xsl|xslt|svg|rss|atom|wsdl|csproj|vbproj|fsproj|proj|props|targets|nuspec|resx|config|manifest|plist|storyboard|xib)$"

## Processing instructions / declaration / DOCTYPE
color #888 "<\?[^?]*\?>"
color #888 "<!DOCTYPE[^>]*>"
## CDATA sections
color #6a5 start="<!\[CDATA\[" end="\]\]>"

## Tag delimiters
color #888 "</?|/?>"
## Tag names
color #59c "</?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_:.-]*"
## Attribute names
color #9df "[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_:.-]*="
## Attribute values / strings
color #c97 ""[^"]*"|'[^']*'"
## Entities  &amp;  &#123;
color #dda "&[A-Za-z#][A-Za-z0-9]*;"

## Comments
color #6a5 start="<!--" end="-->"
